						</p>
					</li>
					<li>
						<p>
							Lashonda never wears blue.
						</p>
					</li>
				</ol>
			</p>
			</statement>
			<solution>
				<p>
				<ol marker="a)">
					<li>
						<p>
							Not everyone should see this movie, or Some people should not see this movie.
						</p>
					</li>
					<li>
						<p>
							Lashonda does wear blue, or Lashonda sometimes wears blue.
						</p>
					</li>
				</ol>
				</p>
